## If you want to add or subtract month, days, hours, minutes from a timestamp 
## https://www.w3schools.com/sql/func_sqlserver_dateadd.asp

## Use the dateadd function 

## Example of adding 18 years to the date 
SELECT BirthDate, DATEADD(year, 18, BirthDate) AS DateAdd FROM Employees;

## Example of subtracting 1 hour from timestamp 
SELECT in_store_txn_time_PHX, dateadd(hour,-1,in_store_txn_time_PHX) AS in_store_txn_time_PHX;

